  m_text: "Welcome back Detective, we are once again requesting your laser ballistics
    expertise to investigate a crime scene, and a peculiar one at that.\nThe killer
    used an experimental bullet developed by the KGB, the L\xFCger Bouncer, capable
    of bouncing off every reflective surface it finds. \nUsing your state-of-the-art
    lasers, and photoreceptors, reconstruct the projectile's trajectory through the
    crime scene, identify the exact origin point of the shot and help us catch this
    killer."
